<title>JAPAN: Nomura - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nomura - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 15, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.08		vs	   26.77</p>
<p> Operating	  262    million    vs	  359    million</p>
<p> Current	    505    million    vs	  560    million</p>
<p> Net		  255    million    vs	  490    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.27 yen	  vs	   15.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     31 million	  vs	  31 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nomura Co Ltd is a leading contractor for displays in commercial, cultural and exhibition facilities.</p>
